{
  "video_id": "j06_M-fADjM",
  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "Saludos<00:00:00.700><c> cordiales.</c><00:00:01.200><c> Pues</c><00:00:01.400><c> fíjate,</c><00:00:01.800><c> bitcoin</c>\n00:00:02.390 --> 00:00:02.400 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:00:00.300",
      "end": "00:00:02.390",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Saludos cordiales. Pues fíjate, bitcoin\nhoy<00:00:02.900><c> que</c><00:00:03.200><c> es</c><00:00:03.600><c> jueves</c><00:00:04.000><c> 5</c>\n00:00:05.990 --> 00:00:06.000 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:00:02.400",
      "end": "00:00:05.990",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "hoy que es jueves 5\nahora<00:00:06.100><c> mismo</c><00:00:06.300><c> son</c><00:00:06.600><c> las</c><00:00:06.800><c> 9:25</c><00:00:07.800><c> minutos,</c><00:00:08.300><c> hace</c>\n00:00:08.490 --> 00:00:08.500 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:00:06.000",
      "end": "00:00:08.490",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "ahora mismo son las 9:25 minutos, hace\n25<00:00:09.100><c> minutos</c><00:00:09.500><c> que</c><00:00:09.600><c> ha</c><00:00:09.600><c> abierto</c><00:00:10.300><c> la</c><00:00:10.400><c> sesión</c>\n00:00:10.690 --> 00:00:10.700 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:00:08.500",
      "end": "00:00:10.690",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "25 minutos que ha abierto la sesión\neuropea,<00:00:11.700><c> no</c><00:00:11.900><c> se</c><00:00:12.000><c> mueve</c><00:00:12.200><c> el</c><00:00:12.300><c> precio.</c><00:00:12.900><c> Quiero</c>\n00:00:13.090 --> 00:00:13.100 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:00:10.700",
      "end": "00:00:13.090",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "europea, no se mueve el precio. Quiero\nque<00:00:13.200><c> te</c><00:00:13.300><c> fijes</c><00:00:13.700><c> primeramente</c><00:00:14.300><c> en</c><00:00:14.400><c> este</c>\n00:00:14.490 --> 00:00:14.500 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:00:13.100",
      "end": "00:00:14.490",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "que te fijes primeramente en este\ngráfico<00:00:15.000><c> de</c><00:00:15.100><c> corto</c><00:00:15.400><c> plazo</c><00:00:15.700><c> de</c><00:00:15.800><c> 4</c><00:00:16.200><c> horas</c><00:00:16.700><c> para</c>\n00:00:16.890 --> 00:00:16.900 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:00:14.500",
      "end": "00:00:16.890",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "gráfico de corto plazo de 4 horas para\nque<00:00:17.000><c> veas</c><00:00:17.200><c> lo</c><00:00:17.300><c> astuto</c><00:00:18.200><c> cómo</c><00:00:18.500><c> se</c><00:00:18.600><c> comporta</c><00:00:19.100><c> el</c>\n00:00:19.190 --> 00:00:19.200 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:00:16.900",
      "end": "00:00:19.190",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "que veas lo astuto cómo se comporta el\nmercado.<00:00:20.200><c> ¿Por</c><00:00:20.400><c> qué</c><00:00:20.500><c> te</c><00:00:20.600><c> digo</c><00:00:20.800><c> esto?</c><00:00:21.200><c> 80.308.</c>\n00:00:23.290 --> 00:00:23.300 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:00:19.200",
      "end": "00:00:23.290",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "mercado. ¿Por qué te digo esto? 80.308.\nSabemos<00:00:23.700><c> que</c><00:00:23.900><c> será</c><00:00:24.200><c> el</c><00:00:24.500><c> precio</c><00:00:25.600><c> que</c><00:00:25.700><c> ahora</c>\n00:00:26.190 --> 00:00:26.200 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:00:23.300",
      "end": "00:00:26.190",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sabemos que será el precio que ahora\nahora<00:00:26.400><c> te</c><00:00:26.500><c> lo</c><00:00:26.600><c> voy</c><00:00:26.700><c> a</c><00:00:26.800><c> dibujar,</c><00:00:27.400><c> que</c><00:00:27.600><c> será</c><00:00:27.800><c> el</c>\n00:00:27.890 --> 00:00:27.900 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:00:26.200",
      "end": "00:00:27.890",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "ahora te lo voy a dibujar, que será el\nprecio<00:00:28.400><c> de</c><00:00:28.500><c> la</c><00:00:28.700><c> fase</c>\n00:00:29.990 --> 00:00:30.000 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:00:27.900",
      "end": "00:00:29.990",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "precio de la fase\ncon<00:00:30.200><c> la</c><00:00:30.200><c> mayor</c><00:00:30.500><c> fase</c><00:00:30.700><c> de</c><00:00:30.800><c> caída,</c><00:00:31.200><c> la</c><00:00:31.300><c> primera</c>\n00:00:31.590 --> 00:00:31.600 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:00:30.000",
      "end": "00:00:31.590",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "con la mayor fase de caída, la primera\nfase<00:00:31.900><c> de</c><00:00:32.000><c> caída</c><00:00:32.300><c> que</c><00:00:32.400><c> tuvo</c><00:00:32.700><c> en</c><00:00:32.800><c> el</c><00:00:32.800><c> corto</c><00:00:33.100><c> plazo</c>\n00:00:33.390 --> 00:00:33.400 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:00:31.600",
      "end": "00:00:33.390",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "fase de caída que tuvo en el corto plazo\nen<00:00:33.500><c> 4</c><00:00:33.800><c> horas.</c>\n00:00:34.790 --> 00:00:34.800 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:00:33.400",
      "end": "00:00:34.790",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "en 4 horas.\nDesde<00:00:35.000><c> ahí</c><00:00:35.100><c> estuvimos</c><00:00:35.600><c> deduciendo</c><00:00:36.100><c> los</c>\n00:00:36.390 --> 00:00:36.400 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:00:34.800",
      "end": "00:00:36.390",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Desde ahí estuvimos deduciendo los\nprecios<00:00:37.100><c> eh</c><00:00:37.500><c> para</c><00:00:37.800><c> las</c><00:00:38.100><c> ventas</c><00:00:38.400><c> en</c><00:00:38.500><c> corto</c><00:00:38.800><c> como</c>\n00:00:38.990 --> 00:00:39.000 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:00:36.400",
      "end": "00:00:38.990",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "precios eh para las ventas en corto como\n84.579,\n00:00:40.990 --> 00:00:41.000 align:start position:0%",
