      "text": "estuvo bastante alcista,\npero<00:01:59.300><c> dejan</c><00:01:59.600><c> a</c><00:01:59.700><c> bitcoin</c>\n00:02:00.782 --> 00:02:00.792 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:01:58.900",
      "end": "00:02:00.782",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "pero dejan a bitcoin\nen<00:02:01.092><c> un</c><00:02:01.192><c> nivel</c><00:02:02.292><c> donde</c><00:02:03.092><c> ahí</c><00:02:03.292><c> te</c><00:02:03.392><c> dejo</c><00:02:03.592><c> la</c><00:02:03.692><c> pelota</c>\n00:02:04.282 --> 00:02:04.292 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:02:00.792",
      "end": "00:02:04.282",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "en un nivel donde ahí te dejo la pelota\na ver<00:02:04.592><c> quién</c><00:02:04.892><c> la</c><00:02:04.992><c> mueve</c><00:02:05.692><c> en</c><00:02:05.892><c> el</c><00:02:05.892><c> centro</c><00:02:06.292><c> del</c>\n00:02:06.382 --> 00:02:06.392 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:02:04.292",
      "end": "00:02:06.382",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "a ver quién la mueve en el centro del\ncampo.\n00:02:16.882 --> 00:02:16.892 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:02:06.392",
      "end": "00:02:16.882",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "en la<00:02:16.992><c> parte</c><00:02:17.292><c> alta,</c><00:02:17.592><c> está</c><00:02:17.792><c> cayendo.</c><00:02:18.392><c> Sabemos</c>\n00:02:18.682 --> 00:02:18.692 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:02:16.892",
      "end": "00:02:18.682",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "en la parte alta, está cayendo. Sabemos\nque<00:02:18.792><c> 71.509</c><00:02:19.892><c> es</c><00:02:19.892><c> el</c><00:02:19.992><c> precio</c><00:02:20.292><c> que</c><00:02:20.292><c> hay</c><00:02:20.392><c> por</c>\n00:02:20.482 --> 00:02:20.492 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:02:18.692",
      "end": "00:02:20.482",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "que 71.509 es el precio que hay por\ndebajo,<00:02:20.892><c> sin</c><00:02:21.092><c> embargo,</c>\n00:02:22.082 --> 00:02:22.092 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:02:20.492",
      "end": "00:02:22.082",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "debajo, sin embargo,\nlo<00:02:22.192><c> ponen</c><00:02:22.592><c> y</c><00:02:22.692><c> lo</c><00:02:22.792><c> dejan</c><00:02:22.992><c> ahí</c><00:02:23.092><c> refugiado</c><00:02:23.792><c> desde</c>\n00:02:23.982 --> 00:02:23.992 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:02:22.092",
      "end": "00:02:23.982",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "lo ponen y lo dejan ahí refugiado desde\nayer<00:02:24.192><c> por</c><00:02:24.292><c> la</c><00:02:24.392><c> tarde</c><00:02:25.192><c> en</c><00:02:25.392><c> esa</c><00:02:25.492><c> subida</c>\n00:02:26.582 --> 00:02:26.592 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:02:23.992",
      "end": "00:02:26.582",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "ayer por la tarde en esa subida\ny, como<00:02:26.792><c> te</c><00:02:26.892><c> digo,</c><00:02:27.492><c> a</c><00:02:27.592><c> ver</c><00:02:27.792><c> quién</c><00:02:27.992><c> le</c><00:02:28.092><c> da</c><00:02:28.192><c> la</c>\n00:02:28.282 --> 00:02:28.292 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:02:26.592",
      "end": "00:02:28.282",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "y, como te digo, a ver quién le da la\npatadita<00:02:28.792><c> al</c><00:02:28.892><c> balón,</c>\n00:02:29.882 --> 00:02:29.892 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:02:28.292",
      "end": "00:02:29.882",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
