      "start": "00:02:29.892",
      "end": "00:02:32.082",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "si los alcistas o los bajistas.\nY<00:02:32.292><c> si,</c><00:02:32.492><c> claro,</c>\n00:02:33.482 --> 00:02:33.492 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:02:32.092",
      "end": "00:02:33.482",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Y si, claro,\nhoy<00:02:33.692><c> vamos</c><00:02:33.992><c> viendo</c><00:02:34.592><c> de</c><00:02:34.792><c> que</c><00:02:35.592><c> bitcoin</c><00:02:36.092><c> parece</c>\n00:02:36.482 --> 00:02:36.492 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:02:33.492",
      "end": "00:02:36.482",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "hoy vamos viendo de que bitcoin parece\nque<00:02:36.592><c> va</c><00:02:36.692><c> a</c><00:02:36.792><c> seguir</c><00:02:37.092><c> subir</c><00:02:37.692><c> y</c><00:02:37.792><c> los</c><00:02:37.992><c> minoristas</c>\n00:02:38.782 --> 00:02:38.792 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:02:36.492",
      "end": "00:02:38.782",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "que va a seguir subir y los minoristas\nempiezan<00:02:39.292><c> a</c><00:02:39.292><c> comprar</c><00:02:39.792><c> porque</c><00:02:40.192><c> tienen</c><00:02:40.492><c> miedo</c>\n00:02:40.782 --> 00:02:40.792 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:02:38.792",
      "end": "00:02:40.782",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "empiezan a comprar porque tienen miedo\nde<00:02:40.892><c> perderse</c><00:02:41.392><c> la</c><00:02:41.492><c> subida</c>\n00:02:43.082 --> 00:02:43.092 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:02:40.792",
      "end": "00:02:43.082",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "de perderse la subida\ny<00:02:43.192><c> vienen</c><00:02:43.692><c> y</c><00:02:43.792><c> continúan</c><00:02:44.492><c> con</c><00:02:44.692><c> la</c><00:02:44.792><c> distribución</c>\n00:02:46.482 --> 00:02:46.492 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:02:43.092",
      "end": "00:02:46.482",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "y vienen y continúan con la distribución\nde<00:02:46.692><c> y</c><00:02:46.892><c> las</c><00:02:46.992><c> ventas</c><00:02:47.292><c> en</c><00:02:47.492><c> corto,</c><00:02:48.392><c> eso</c><00:02:48.792><c> todavía</c><00:02:49.192><c> no</c>\n00:02:49.282 --> 00:02:49.292 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:02:46.492",
      "end": "00:02:49.282",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "de y las ventas en corto, eso todavía no\nparece<00:02:49.592><c> haber</c><00:02:49.892><c> terminado,</c>\n00:02:51.482 --> 00:02:51.492 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:02:49.292",
      "end": "00:02:51.482",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "parece haber terminado,\n¿qué<00:02:51.592><c> puede</c><00:02:51.792><c> ocurrir?</c><00:02:52.692><c> Pues</c><00:02:52.792><c> que</c><00:02:52.892><c> dejen</c><00:02:53.192><c> esa</c>\n00:02:53.282 --> 00:02:53.292 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:02:51.492",
      "end": "00:02:53.282",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "¿qué puede ocurrir? Pues que dejen esa\ntrampa<00:02:53.692><c> intradía,</c><00:02:54.192><c> es</c><00:02:54.292><c> decir,</c><00:02:55.092><c> yo</c><00:02:55.392><c> no</c><00:02:55.492><c> sé</c><00:02:55.592><c> lo</c>\n00:02:55.682 --> 00:02:55.692 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:02:53.292",
      "end": "00:02:55.682",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "trampa intradía, es decir, yo no sé lo\nque<00:02:55.792><c> va</c><00:02:55.892><c> a</c><00:02:55.892><c> pasar</c><00:02:56.492><c> igual</c><00:02:56.692><c> que</c><00:02:56.792><c> no</c><00:02:56.892><c> lo</c><00:02:56.992><c> sabe</c>\n00:02:57.182 --> 00:02:57.192 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:02:55.692",
      "end": "00:02:57.182",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "que va a pasar igual que no lo sabe\nnadie,<00:02:57.692><c> pero</c><00:02:57.892><c> lo</c><00:02:57.992><c> que</c><00:02:58.092><c> sí</c><00:02:58.192><c> sé</c><00:02:58.492><c> es</c><00:02:58.692><c> lo</c><00:02:58.992><c> que</c><00:02:58.992><c> está</c>\n00:02:59.182 --> 00:02:59.192 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:02:57.192",
      "end": "00:02:59.182",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "nadie, pero lo que sí sé es lo que está\npasando,<00:02:59.692><c> dónde</c><00:02:59.892><c> está</c><00:03:00.092><c> el</c><00:03:00.192><c> precio</c><00:03:00.792><c> y</c><00:03:00.892><c> qué</c><00:03:00.992><c> está</c>\n00:03:01.182 --> 00:03:01.192 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:02:59.192",
      "end": "00:03:01.182",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "pasando, dónde está el precio y qué está\nhaciendo.<00:03:01.592><c> Entonces,</c><00:03:02.092><c> partimos,</c><00:03:03.192><c> ya</c><00:03:03.392><c> nos</c>\n00:03:03.682 --> 00:03:03.692 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:03:01.192",
      "end": "00:03:03.682",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "haciendo. Entonces, partimos, ya nos\ndedicamos<00:03:04.192><c> a</c><00:03:04.192><c> ver</c><00:03:04.492><c> directamente</c><00:03:05.092><c> el</c><00:03:05.192><c> gráfico,</c>\n00:03:05.882 --> 00:03:05.892 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:03:03.692",
      "end": "00:03:05.882",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "dedicamos a ver directamente el gráfico,\npartimos<00:03:06.292><c> de</c><00:03:06.392><c> aquí</c><00:03:06.592><c> de</c><00:03:06.592><c> los</c><00:03:06.792><c> 80.308.</c>\n00:03:08.582 --> 00:03:08.592 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:03:05.892",
      "end": "00:03:08.582",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "partimos de aquí de los 80.308.\nEse<00:03:08.892><c> era</c><00:03:09.292><c> todo</c><00:03:09.592><c> el</c><00:03:09.692><c> cálculo</c><00:03:10.492><c> que</c><00:03:10.892><c> se</c><00:03:11.092><c> realizó</c>\n00:03:11.682 --> 00:03:11.692 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:03:08.592",
      "end": "00:03:11.682",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Ese era todo el cálculo que se realizó\nde<00:03:11.792><c> la</c><00:03:12.092><c> fase</c><00:03:12.792><c> que</c><00:03:12.892><c> venía</c><00:03:13.592><c> el</c><00:03:13.792><c> precio</c><00:03:14.092><c> bajando</c><00:03:14.892><c> y</c>\n00:03:14.982 --> 00:03:14.992 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:03:11.692",
      "end": "00:03:14.982",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "de la fase que venía el precio bajando y\ndonde<00:03:15.192><c> podía</c><00:03:15.392><c> aumentar</c><00:03:15.592><c> esa</c><00:03:15.892><c> presión</c><00:03:16.092><c> bajista</c>\n00:03:16.682 --> 00:03:16.692 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:03:14.992",
      "end": "00:03:16.682",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "donde podía aumentar esa presión bajista\ny<00:03:16.792><c> ahí</c><00:03:16.992><c> está</c><00:03:17.192><c> detenido.</c><00:03:17.992><c> Entonces,</c><00:03:18.292><c> va</c><00:03:18.292><c> a</c><00:03:18.392><c> ser</c>\n00:03:18.482 --> 00:03:18.492 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:03:16.692",
      "end": "00:03:18.482",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "y ahí está detenido. Entonces, va a ser\nel<00:03:18.792><c> nivel</c><00:03:19.492><c> importante,</c><00:03:20.192><c> el</c><00:03:20.292><c> precio</c>\n00:03:20.582 --> 00:03:20.592 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:03:18.492",
      "end": "00:03:20.582",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "el nivel importante, el precio\nimportante<00:03:21.192><c> en</c><00:03:21.292><c> el</c><00:03:21.392><c> día</c><00:03:21.592><c> de</c><00:03:21.792><c> hoy,</c><00:03:22.092><c> porque</c><00:03:22.292><c> por</c>\n00:03:22.382 --> 00:03:22.392 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:03:20.592",
      "end": "00:03:22.382",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "importante en el día de hoy, porque por\ndebajo<00:03:22.692><c> todavía</c><00:03:23.092><c> tenemos</c><00:03:23.392><c> los</c><00:03:23.492><c> 73.397</c>\n00:03:25.182 --> 00:03:25.192 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:03:22.392",
      "end": "00:03:25.182",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "debajo todavía tenemos los 73.397\ncomo<00:03:25.492><c> tercer</c><00:03:25.892><c> objetivo</c><00:03:26.292><c> y</c><00:03:26.392><c> ya</c><00:03:26.492><c> después</c>\n00:03:26.782 --> 00:03:26.792 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:03:25.192",
      "end": "00:03:26.782",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "como tercer objetivo y ya después\naparecen<00:03:27.192><c> los</c><00:03:27.292><c> 71.509,</c>\n00:03:28.882 --> 00:03:28.892 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:03:26.792",
      "end": "00:03:28.882",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "aparecen los 71.509,\n69.997\n00:03:30.482 --> 00:03:30.492 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:03:28.892",
      "end": "00:03:30.482",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "69.997\ny los<00:03:30.692><c> 69.000.</c><00:03:31.392><c> Si</c><00:03:31.492><c> nos</c><00:03:31.692><c> venimos</c><00:03:31.992><c> a</c><00:03:32.092><c> la</c><00:03:32.192><c> serie</c>\n00:03:32.582 --> 00:03:32.592 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:03:30.492",
      "end": "00:03:32.582",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "y los 69.000. Si nos venimos a la serie\ndiaria,<00:03:33.392><c> entonces,</c><00:03:34.092><c> como</c><00:03:34.292><c> te</c><00:03:34.392><c> digo,</c><00:03:34.992><c> aquí</c>\n00:03:35.182 --> 00:03:35.192 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:03:32.592",
      "end": "00:03:35.182",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "diaria, entonces, como te digo, aquí\ntodavía<00:03:35.592><c> no</c><00:03:35.692><c> ha</c><00:03:35.792><c> cambiado</c><00:03:36.192><c> nada.</c><00:03:36.892><c> De</c><00:03:36.992><c> hecho,</c>\n00:03:37.182 --> 00:03:37.192 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:03:35.192",
      "end": "00:03:37.182",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "todavía no ha cambiado nada. De hecho,\nsi<00:03:37.292><c> nos</c><00:03:37.492><c> fijamos,</c><00:03:38.292><c> siempre</c><00:03:38.592><c> estuve</c><00:03:38.792><c> diciendo</c>\n00:03:39.182 --> 00:03:39.192 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:03:37.192",
      "end": "00:03:39.182",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "si nos fijamos, siempre estuve diciendo\nmáximos<00:03:39.892><c> decrecientes.</c><00:03:40.692><c> Vale,</c><00:03:41.092><c> pues</c><00:03:41.392><c> voy</c><00:03:41.892><c> a</c>\n00:03:42.282 --> 00:03:42.292 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:03:39.192",
      "end": "00:03:42.282",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "máximos decrecientes. Vale, pues voy a\nvamos<00:03:42.492><c> a</c><00:03:42.492><c> extender</c><00:03:43.492><c> un</c><00:03:43.492><c> momentito</c><00:03:44.492><c> desde</c><00:03:44.892><c> el</c>\n00:03:45.082 --> 00:03:45.092 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:03:42.292",
      "end": "00:03:45.082",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "vamos a extender un momentito desde el\nprimero<00:03:45.492><c> incluso</c><00:03:45.792><c> hasta</c><00:03:46.092><c> el</c><00:03:46.092><c> último,</c><00:03:46.892><c> ¿vale?</c>\n00:03:47.382 --> 00:03:47.392 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:03:45.092",
      "end": "00:03:47.382",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "primero incluso hasta el último, ¿vale?\nY<00:03:47.492><c> fíjate</c><00:03:47.892><c> como</c><00:03:48.192><c> le</c><00:03:48.292><c> cierra</c><00:03:48.692><c> el</c><00:03:48.792><c> paso</c><00:03:49.292><c> justo</c>\n00:03:49.882 --> 00:03:49.892 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:03:47.392",
      "end": "00:03:49.882",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Y fíjate como le cierra el paso justo\nayer<00:03:50.592><c> que</c><00:03:50.692><c> también</c><00:03:50.992><c> coincidía</c><00:03:51.492><c> ahí</c><00:03:51.692><c> con</c><00:03:51.792><c> los</c>\n00:03:51.882 --> 00:03:51.892 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:03:49.892",
      "end": "00:03:51.882",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "ayer que también coincidía ahí con los\n80.308.\n00:03:53.682 --> 00:03:53.692 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:03:51.892",
      "end": "00:03:53.682",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "80.308.\nEn<00:03:53.792><c> el</c><00:03:53.892><c> momento</c><00:03:54.392><c> en</c><00:03:54.592><c> que</c><00:03:54.792><c> toca</c><00:03:55.092><c> esa</c><00:03:55.292><c> directriz</c>\n00:03:55.982 --> 00:03:55.992 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:03:53.692",
      "end": "00:03:55.982",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "En el momento en que toca esa directriz\nque<00:03:56.092><c> dibujamos</c><00:03:56.692><c> uniendo</c><00:03:57.192><c> el</c><00:03:57.292><c> primer</c><00:03:57.692><c> y</c><00:03:57.792><c> el</c>\n00:03:57.882 --> 00:03:57.892 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:03:55.992",
      "end": "00:03:57.882",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "que dibujamos uniendo el primer y el\núltimo<00:03:58.192><c> máximo,</c><00:03:58.992><c> que</c><00:03:59.092><c> es</c><00:03:59.092><c> como</c><00:03:59.292><c> se</c><00:03:59.392><c> hace</c><00:03:59.592><c> en</c><00:03:59.592><c> la</c>\n00:03:59.682 --> 00:03:59.692 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:03:57.892",
      "end": "00:03:59.682",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "último máximo, que es como se hace en la\nacción<00:03:59.992><c> del</c><00:04:00.092><c> precio,</c><00:04:00.692><c> fíjate</c><00:04:00.992><c> lo</c><00:04:01.092><c> que</c><00:04:01.192><c> ocurre.</c>\n00:04:01.782 --> 00:04:01.792 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:03:59.692",
      "end": "00:04:01.782",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "acción del precio, fíjate lo que ocurre.\nY<00:04:01.892><c> ahora</c><00:04:01.992><c> mismo</c><00:04:02.192><c> está</c><00:04:02.394><c> detenido</c><00:04:02.894><c> por</c><00:04:02.994><c> debajo.</c>\n00:04:03.384 --> 00:04:03.394 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:04:01.792",
      "end": "00:04:03.384",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Y ahora mismo está detenido por debajo.\nEntonces,<00:04:04.094><c> desde</c><00:04:04.294><c> mi</c><00:04:04.394><c> punto</c><00:04:04.694><c> de</c><00:04:04.794><c> vista,</c><00:04:05.394><c> desde</c>\n00:04:05.684 --> 00:04:05.694 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:04:03.394",
      "end": "00:04:05.684",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Entonces, desde mi punto de vista, desde\nmi<00:04:05.794><c> forma</c><00:04:06.594><c> de</c><00:04:06.694><c> operar</c><00:04:07.094><c> mercado</c><00:04:07.494><c> desde</c><00:04:07.794><c> 1988</c>\n00:04:09.284 --> 00:04:09.294 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:04:05.694",
      "end": "00:04:09.284",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "mi forma de operar mercado desde 1988\ncon<00:04:09.694><c> el</c><00:04:09.894><c> método,</c><00:04:10.194><c> con</c><00:04:10.294><c> la</c><00:04:10.394><c> gestión</c><00:04:10.794><c> de</c><00:04:10.994><c> riesgo,</c>\n00:04:11.484 --> 00:04:11.494 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:04:09.294",
      "end": "00:04:11.484",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "con el método, con la gestión de riesgo,\ncon<00:04:11.694><c> mi</c><00:04:11.794><c> estrategia,</c><00:04:12.394><c> mi</c><00:04:12.494><c> estrategia,</c><00:04:13.194><c> en</c><00:04:13.394><c> mi</c>\n00:04:13.484 --> 00:04:13.494 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:04:11.494",
      "end": "00:04:13.484",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "con mi estrategia, mi estrategia, en mi\nplan<00:04:13.794><c> ahí,</c><00:04:14.194><c> porque</c><00:04:14.494><c> en</c><00:04:14.494><c> un</c><00:04:14.594><c> plan</c><00:04:14.894><c> lo</c><00:04:14.994><c> primero</c>\n00:04:15.284 --> 00:04:15.294 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:04:13.494",
      "end": "00:04:15.284",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "plan ahí, porque en un plan lo primero\nque<00:04:15.394><c> uno</c><00:04:15.594><c> dice</c><00:04:15.894><c> en</c><00:04:15.894><c> la</c><00:04:15.994><c> estrategia</c><00:04:16.694><c> es,</c><00:04:17.194><c> oye,</c>\n00:04:17.684 --> 00:04:17.694 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:04:15.294",
      "end": "00:04:17.684",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "que uno dice en la estrategia es, oye,\n¿qué<00:04:18.294><c> ¿cómo</c><00:04:18.494><c> está</c><00:04:18.694><c> la</c><00:04:18.794><c> tendencia?</c><00:04:19.594><c> La</c>\n00:04:19.684 --> 00:04:19.694 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:04:17.694",
      "end": "00:04:19.684",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "¿qué ¿cómo está la tendencia? La\ntendencia<00:04:20.094><c> yo</c><00:04:20.294><c> la</c><00:04:20.294><c> voy</c><00:04:20.494><c> mirando</c><00:04:20.894><c> por</c><00:04:21.094><c> fases.</c>\n00:04:21.684 --> 00:04:21.694 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:04:19.694",
      "end": "00:04:21.684",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "tendencia yo la voy mirando por fases.\n¿Cómo<00:04:21.894><c> están</c><00:04:22.194><c> las</c><00:04:22.294><c> zonas?</c><00:04:22.894><c> Las</c><00:04:22.994><c> zonas</c><00:04:23.294><c> son</c><00:04:23.394><c> los</c>\n00:04:23.584 --> 00:04:23.594 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:04:21.694",
      "end": "00:04:23.584",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "¿Cómo están las zonas? Las zonas son los\nprecios,<00:04:24.294><c> ¿vale?</c><00:04:24.794><c> Y</c><00:04:24.894><c> después</c><00:04:25.494><c> voy</c><00:04:25.694><c> mirando</c><00:04:26.394><c> si</c>\n00:04:26.684 --> 00:04:26.694 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:04:23.594",
      "end": "00:04:26.684",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "precios, ¿vale? Y después voy mirando si\nhay<00:04:26.894><c> vacío</c><00:04:27.494><c> disponible,</c><00:04:28.094><c> voy</c><00:04:28.194><c> poniendo</c><00:04:28.594><c> más</c>\n00:04:28.784 --> 00:04:28.794 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:04:26.694",
      "end": "00:04:28.784",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "hay vacío disponible, voy poniendo más\nporque<00:04:29.194><c> es</c><00:04:29.294><c> lo</c><00:04:29.394><c> que</c><00:04:29.494><c> voy</c><00:04:29.594><c> haciendo,</c><00:04:29.894><c> voy</c>\n00:04:30.084 --> 00:04:30.094 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:04:28.794",
      "end": "00:04:30.084",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "porque es lo que voy haciendo, voy\nsumando<00:04:30.894><c> cada</c><00:04:31.094><c> cosa</c><00:04:31.394><c> de</c><00:04:31.394><c> estas</c><00:04:31.694><c> que</c><00:04:31.694><c> voy</c>\n00:04:31.884 --> 00:04:31.894 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:04:30.094",
      "end": "00:04:31.884",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "sumando cada cosa de estas que voy\nmirando.<00:04:32.194><c> El</c><00:04:32.294><c> vacío</c><00:04:32.594><c> disponible</c><00:04:33.094><c> es</c><00:04:33.494><c> si</c><00:04:33.694><c> tengo</c>\n00:04:34.084 --> 00:04:34.094 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:04:31.894",
      "end": "00:04:34.084",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "mirando. El vacío disponible es si tengo\nprecios<00:04:34.794><c> que</c><00:04:34.894><c> permitan</c><00:04:35.394><c> respirar,</c><00:04:36.294><c> es</c><00:04:36.394><c> decir,</c>\n00:04:36.584 --> 00:04:36.594 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:04:34.094",
      "end": "00:04:36.584",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "precios que permitan respirar, es decir,\nque<00:04:36.794><c> nadie</c><00:04:36.994><c> vaya</c><00:04:37.194><c> a</c><00:04:37.294><c> tomar</c><00:04:37.494><c> objetivos</c><00:04:38.094><c> en</c><00:04:38.194><c> el</c>\n00:04:38.284 --> 00:04:38.294 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:04:36.594",
      "end": "00:04:38.284",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "que nadie vaya a tomar objetivos en el\ncorto<00:04:38.594><c> plazo</c><00:04:39.094><c> muy</c><00:04:39.194><c> cercano.</c><00:04:39.994><c> En</c><00:04:40.094><c> este</c><00:04:40.294><c> caso</c>\n00:04:40.484 --> 00:04:40.494 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:04:38.294",
      "end": "00:04:40.484",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "corto plazo muy cercano. En este caso\ntenemos<00:04:40.894><c> los</c><00:04:40.994><c> 83,366</c>\n00:04:42.584 --> 00:04:42.594 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:04:40.494",
      "end": "00:04:42.584",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "tenemos los 83,366\npor<00:04:42.694><c> la</c><00:04:42.794><c> parte</c><00:04:43.094><c> de</c><00:04:43.094><c> arriba,</c><00:04:43.894><c> también</c><00:04:44.394><c> los</c>\n00:04:44.584 --> 00:04:44.594 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:04:42.594",
      "end": "00:04:44.584",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "por la parte de arriba, también los\n81,446.\n00:04:47.084 --> 00:04:47.094 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:04:44.594",
      "end": "00:04:47.084",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "81,446.\nBueno,<00:04:47.294><c> pues</c><00:04:47.394><c> ya</c><00:04:47.694><c> sabemos</c><00:04:48.194><c> toda</c><00:04:48.394><c> esa</c><00:04:48.594><c> parte</c>\n00:04:48.884 --> 00:04:48.894 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:04:47.094",
      "end": "00:04:48.884",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bueno, pues ya sabemos toda esa parte\nque<00:04:49.094><c> hay</c><00:04:49.694><c> y</c><00:04:49.894><c> que</c><00:04:49.994><c> además</c><00:04:50.694><c> los</c><00:04:51.094><c> mejores</c><00:04:51.594><c> precios</c>\n00:04:51.884 --> 00:04:51.894 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:04:48.894",
      "end": "00:04:51.884",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "que hay y que además los mejores precios\nde compras<00:04:52.594><c> no</c><00:04:52.894><c> lo</c><00:04:52.994><c> llegó</c><00:04:53.294><c> a</c><00:04:53.294><c> tocar,</c><00:04:53.694><c> 75,518,</c>\n00:04:55.384 --> 00:04:55.394 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:04:51.894",
      "end": "00:04:55.384",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "de compras no lo llegó a tocar, 75,518,\npero<00:04:55.494><c> son</c><00:04:55.694><c> los</c><00:04:55.794><c> mejores</c><00:04:56.194><c> precios</c><00:04:56.494><c> de</c><00:04:56.594><c> compras</c>\n00:04:57.184 --> 00:04:57.194 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:04:55.394",
      "end": "00:04:57.184",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "pero son los mejores precios de compras\nestos<00:04:57.494><c> de</c><00:04:57.594><c> aquí.</c><00:04:58.194><c> Por</c><00:04:58.294><c> lo</c><00:04:58.294><c> tanto,</c><00:04:58.694><c> para</c><00:04:58.894><c> mí,</c>\n00:04:59.284 --> 00:04:59.294 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:04:57.194",
      "end": "00:04:59.284",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "estos de aquí. Por lo tanto, para mí,\nvamos<00:04:59.594><c> a</c><00:04:59.594><c> ver</c><00:04:59.794><c> cómo</c><00:05:00.094><c> abre</c><00:05:00.194><c> hoy</c><00:05:00.394><c> el</c><00:05:00.494><c> mercado,</c>\n00:05:01.084 --> 00:05:01.094 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:04:59.294",
      "end": "00:05:01.084",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "vamos a ver cómo abre hoy el mercado,\nhoy<00:05:01.294><c> jueves,</c><00:05:01.694><c> mañana</c><00:05:02.094><c> viernes</c><00:05:02.494><c> vamos</c><00:05:02.694><c> a</c>\n00:05:02.784 --> 00:05:02.794 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:05:01.094",
      "end": "00:05:02.784",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "hoy jueves, mañana viernes vamos a\nconocer<00:05:03.494><c> las</c><00:05:03.894><c> nóminas</c><00:05:04.294><c> no</c><00:05:04.494><c> agrícolas,</c><00:05:04.894><c> el</c>\n00:05:04.884 --> 00:05:04.894 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:05:02.794",
      "end": "00:05:04.884",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "conocer las nóminas no agrícolas, el\nempleo<00:05:05.294><c> en</c><00:05:05.294><c> Estados</c><00:05:05.694><c> Unidos.</c><00:05:06.294><c> Se</c><00:05:06.394><c> espera</c><00:05:07.094><c> eh</c>\n00:05:08.684 --> 00:05:08.694 align:start position:0%",
      "start": "00:05:04.894",
      "end": "00:05:08.684",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
