      "start": "00:06:07.495",
      "end": "00:06:09.685",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "vemos que IBIT tuvo una fuerte salida,\n200,1<00:06:10.995><c> 201</c><00:06:11.695><c> millones,</c><00:06:12.295><c> coma</c><00:06:12.595><c> dos</c><00:06:12.995><c> de</c><00:06:13.095><c> salida.</c>\n00:06:13.485 --> 00:06:13.495 align:start position:0%",
