      "text": "dentro de los ETF del contado de\nBitcoin.<00:06:35.895><c> De</c><00:06:35.995><c> hecho,</c><00:06:36.195><c> podemos</c><00:06:36.595><c> ver</c><00:06:37.095><c> que</c><00:06:37.195><c> ahora</c>\n00:06:37.385 --> 00:06:37.395 align:start position:0%",
