      "start": "00:06:37.395",
      "end": "00:06:39.885",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "mismo el oro, Ethereum, todos están\nBueno,<00:06:40.095><c> Ethereum</c><00:06:40.395><c> está</c><00:06:40.695><c> prácticamente</c><00:06:41.295><c> en</c>\n00:06:41.385 --> 00:06:41.395 align:start position:0%",
