      "start": "00:06:41.395",
      "end": "00:06:42.985",
      "source": "j06_M-fADjM.es.vtt"
    },
    {
      "text": "plano, le pasa lo mismo que a Bitcoin\ncon<00:06:43.095><c> un</c><00:06:43.195><c> 0,10%</c><00:06:44.695><c> de</c><00:06:44.895><c> subida.</c><00:06:45.595><c> Lo</c><00:06:45.695><c> tienen</c>\n00:06:45.885 --> 00:06:45.895 align:start position:0%",
